The require condition:
(isTopLevelCall && _initialized < 1) ||
(!AddressUpgradeable.isContract(address(this)) && _initialized == 1)

This is OZ v4.9? Actually newer Initializable includes _initialized < 1. The second branch allows reinitialization when not a contract and _initialized == 1. That is to allow initialization of non-contract? Hmm.

